   "subject": "package ‘tm’ is not available (for R version 3.0.2)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>&gt; install.packages(&#39;tm&#39;)<br></div><div>Warning message:</div><div>package ‘tm’ is not available (for R version 3.0.2) <br></div><div>&gt; library(&#39;tm&#39;)      # 想說畢竟只是warning</div><div><div>Error in library(&quot;tm&quot;) : there is no package called ‘tm’</div></div><div>&gt;install.packages()</div><div>＃彈出PACKAGES表單</div><div>....</div><div>....</div><div>....</div><div>tlnise</div><div>tmle</div><div>tmle.npvi</div><div>tm.plugin....</div><div><div>tm.plugin....</div></div><div><div>tm.plugin....</div></div><div><div>tm.plugin....</div></div><div><div>tm.plugin....</div></div><div><div>tm.plugin....</div></div><div>tmvtnorm</div><div>tnet</div><div>....</div><div>....#壓根沒有tm packages</div><div><br></div><div>大家好，我硬碟剛壞，電腦是LENOVO THINKPAD E420s，作業系統UBUNTU</div><div><br></div><div>是電腦我選擇英文界面(所以R也是英文) , 在install.packages()的彈出式視窗，我選taipei</div><div><br></div><div>也選過 US(CA01) 都無法安裝。</div><div><br></div><div>安裝時有安裝r-base 也安裝 r-base-dev</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
