   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p>Hi Ric,<div><br></div><div>因 tm 最新版不支援舊版 R in Ubuntu, 如果R不考慮升級, 此時先安裝舊版tm.</div><div><br></div><div><div>1. 依 <a href=\"http://cran.at.r-project.org/src/base/R-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.at.r-project.org/src/base/R-3/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238547100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1poWHGWI1sfx3CKRWlPt1Z\">http://cran.at.r-project.org/src/base/R-3/ </a>網頁顯示 R-3.0.2 發行日期為 25-Sep-2013</div><div><br></div><div>2. 選取 tm-archive 網頁 <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/tm/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/tm/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238547100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QHm-XJ348YYUElYvuEb4N\">http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/tm/</a></div><div><br></div><div>將 tm_0.5-9.tar.gz 下載至 /usr/local/R/R-3.0.2/bin 目錄,即 getwd() 目錄.</div><div><br></div><div>3. 安裝 slam 套件 </div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" color=\"#ff0000\"><b>install.packages(&quot;slam&quot;)</b></font></div><div><br></div><div>4. 安裝 tm_0.5-9 套件</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\" color=\"#ff0000\"><b>install.packages(&quot;tm_0.5-9.tar.gz&quot;, type=&quot;source&quot;)</b></font></div><div><br></div><div>參考附件結果.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Px_S_zYyFQA/U9pWr4L6UyI/AAAAAAAAE6E/cFmVq539bbo/s1600/tm.install.1.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Px_S_zYyFQA/U9pWr4L6UyI/AAAAAAAAE6E/cFmVq539bbo/s1600/tm.install.1.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238547100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aJBqGBAShyHwiFlSbPzZH\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Px_S_zYyFQA/U9pWr4L6UyI/AAAAAAAAE6E/cFmVq539bbo/s320/tm.install.1.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"211\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kWyGTZ74tJk/U9pWvgO_ZUI/AAAAAAAAE6M/CcueCgRpMIs/s1600/tm.install.2.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kWyGTZ74tJk/U9pWvgO_ZUI/AAAAAAAAE6M/CcueCgRpMIs/s1600/tm.install.2.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238547100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xWdVWBFOmkCDDBeJlmjBS\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kWyGTZ74tJk/U9pWvgO_ZUI/AAAAAAAAE6M/CcueCgRpMIs/s320/tm.install.2.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"206\"></a></p><div><br></div><br>ric E於 2014年7月30日星期三UTC+8下午4時09分08秒寫道：</div>"
